      "clause_id": "§1",
      "text": "Prohibits individuals from carrying a concealed handgun without a permit issued by the county sheriff."
    },
    {
      "clause_id": "§2",
      "text": "Requires the sheriff to issue a concealed carry permit to any applicant who is 21 or older, legally eligible to possess a handgun, and completes an eight-hour safety course."
